# Task 2: Long Beach Animal Shelter

```{r}
library(tidyverse)

animals_raw <- read_csv("data/animals.csv")

animals <- animals_raw |>
  filter(animal_type %in% c("bird", "cat", "dog", "wild", "other")) |>
  filter(intake_type %in% c("owner surrender", "stray", "wildlife")) |>
  filter(
    outcome_type %in% c(
      "outcome_type", "rescue", "adoption", "euthanasia", "transfer",
      "return to owner", "shelter, neuter, return", "died",
      "community cat", "return to wild habitat"
    )
  ) |>
  mutate(
    intake_year = lubridate::year(intake_date),
    intake_month = lubridate::month(intake_date, label = TRUE, abbr = FALSE)
  ) |>
  mutate(across(c(animal_type, intake_type, outcome_type), \(x) str_to_title(x)))
```

## Animal type

### Recreation data 1

```{r}
animal_counts <- animals |>
  group_by(animal_type) |>
  summarize(total = n())
animal_counts
```

The results should be:

| Animal type | Total |
|:--|--:|
| Bird | 1,952 |
| Cat | 13,367 |
| Dog | 8,448 |
| Other | 1,280 |
| Wild | 1,366 |

### Recreation plot 1

```{r}
ggplot(animal_counts, aes(x = animal_type, y = total, fill = animal_type)) +
  geom_col() +
  theme(legend.position = "none")
```

## Outcomes

### Recreation data 2

```{r}
outcome_props <- animals |>
  group_by(outcome_type) |>
  summarize(total = n()) |>
  mutate(proportion = total / sum(total))
outcome_props
```

The results should be approximately:

| Outcome | Total | Proportion |
|:--|--:|--:|
| Adoption | 5,651 | 0.214 |
| Community Cat | 382 | 0.0145 |
| Died | 715 | 0.0271 |
| Euthanasia | 5,250 | 0.199 |
| Rescue | 6,022 | 0.228 |
| Return To Owner | 2,579 | 0.0976 |
| Return To Wild Habitat | 251 | 0.00950 |
| Shelter, Neuter, Return | 911 | 0.0345 |
| Transfer | 4,652 | 0.176 |

What proportion are adopted or rescued?

About 21.4% of the animals were adopted and about 22.8% were rescued. Together, adoption and rescue account for about 44.2% of the animals in this filtered dataset.

### Recreation plot 2

```{r}
ggplot(outcome_props, aes(x = proportion, y = outcome_type)) +
  geom_pointrange(aes(xmin = 0, xmax = proportion))
```

### Recreation plot 3

```{r}
outcome_props <- outcome_props |>
  mutate(outcome_type = fct_reorder(outcome_type, proportion))

ggplot(outcome_props, aes(x = proportion, y = outcome_type)) +
  geom_pointrange(aes(xmin = 0, xmax = proportion))
```

## Intake type over time

### Month intake proportions

```{r}
month_intake_props <- animals |>
  group_by(intake_type, intake_month) |>
  summarize(total = n()) |>
  group_by(intake_type) |>
  mutate(proportion = total / sum(total))
month_intake_props
```

### Recreation plot 4 Heatmap

```{r}
ggplot(
  month_intake_props,
  aes(
    x = intake_type,
    y = fct_rev(intake_month),
    fill = proportion
  )
) +
  geom_tile()
```

